    'A simple direction is:
- practice recall first on a long leash
- reward every return immediately
- allow off-leash freedom only in fenced or very safe areas
- keep sessions short and consistent' => 'Prosty plan:
Najpierw ćwicz przywoływanie psa na długiej lince.
Nagradzaj go natychmiast za każdym razem, gdy wróci.
