    'Uvježbaj: prva cjelovita preporuka' => 'Ćwiczenie: Twoja pierwsza pełna rekomendacja',
    'In the <strong>Events</strong> section, check <strong>checkout.session.completed</strong>, <strong>invoice.paid</strong>, <strong>invoice.payment_failed</strong>, <strong>customer.subscription.updated</strong>, and <strong>customer.subscription.deleted</strong>, then save the webhook.' => 'W sekcji <strong>Events</strong> zaznacz <strong>checkout.session.completed</strong>, <strong>invoice.paid</strong>, <strong>invoice.payment_failed</strong>, <strong>customer.subscription.updated</strong> i <strong>customer.subscription.deleted</strong>, a następnie zapisz webhook.',
